<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Markdown on 오깅중</title><link>https://jun7680.github.io/tags/markdown/</link><description>Recent content in Markdown on 오깅중</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>ko</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 23 Dec 2020 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://jun7680.github.io/tags/markdown/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Notion으로 Posting</title><link>https://jun7680.github.io/p/notion/</link><pubDate>Wed, 23 Dec 2020 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://jun7680.github.io/p/notion/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="글-작성"&gt;글 작성&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;---
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;layout: post
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;title: 제목
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;subtitle: 부제목
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;date: 글 작성 시간
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;categories: 카테고리
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;tags: 테그 or [테그, 테그....]
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;comments: true &amp;lt;- 댓글 사용 여부
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;---
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;layout - 내가 사용한 테마에서는 글 작성시 post, 페이지(상단) 추가시 page.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;title, subtitle 둘다 문자열로 입력.&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;del&gt;처음에 마크다운 문법 에러가 계속 났었는데 알고보니 따옴표&amp;hellip;&lt;/del&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;del&gt;노션이나 다른 곳에서 복사해서 사용할 경우 따옴표에 주의해야 한다.&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>